<view class="service-page course-page"><view class="service-hero"><text class="eyebrow">课程维护</text><text class="page-title">准备一次相遇</text><text class="muted">填写课程名称和开课时间即可发布；进群方式可以稍后补充。发布后可微信分享，家长也能从首页报名。</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">重新读取</button></view><text wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在读取课程…</text>
<view wx:if="{{saveNotice}}" class="card"><text class="section-title">{{saveNotice}}</text><button wx:if="{{savedClass.status === 'PUBLISHED'}}" class="primary" open-type="share">微信分享课程</button></view><form wx:if="{{allowed}}" bindsubmit="publish"><view class="card course-form-card"><text class="section-title">课程信息</text><text class="field-label">课程名称 <text class="required">必填</text></text><input class="course-form-input" value="{{form.title}}" name="title" data-key="title" bindinput="input" maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：读懂孩子的情绪"/><text class="field-label">课程封面</text><text class="muted cover-size-hint">建议使用 2.2:1 横图（如 1100 × 500 px），超出部分会居中裁切。</text><image wx:if="{{coverUrl}}" class="course-cover course-edit-cover" src="{{coverUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button class="secondary" data-kind="cover" bindtap="upload" disabled="{{uploading || busy}}">{{coverUrl ? '更换封面' : '上传封面'}}</button><text class="field-label">课程介绍</text><textarea class="course-form-textarea course-description-input" value="{{form.description}}" name="description" data-key="description" bindinput="input" maxlength="4000" placeholder="适合谁参加，本次会谈些什么"/><text class="field-label">开课城市</text><input class="course-form-input" value="{{form.city}}" name="city" data-key="city" bindinput="input" maxlength="60" placeholder="例如：成都（支持中文）"/><text class="muted form-help">详细地址在课程群内通知。</text>
<text class="field-label">开课时间 <text class="required">发布必填</text></text><view class="entry-grid"><picker mode="date" value="{{form.date}}" name="date" data-key="date" bindchange="input"><view class="picker-field">{{form.date || '选择日期'}}</view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{form.time}}" name="time" data-key="time" bindchange="input"><view class="picker-field">{{form.time || '选择时间'}}</view></picker></view>
<text class="field-label">名额上限</text><input class="course-form-input" type="number" value="{{form.capacity}}" name="capacity" data-key="capacity" bindinput="input" maxlength="5" placeholder="0 表示不限"/><text class="muted form-help">0 表示不限名额，不能小于已报名人数。</text>
<text class="field-label">报名费用（元）</text><input class="course-form-input" type="digit" value="{{form.registrationFee}}" name="registrationFee" data-key="registrationFee" bindinput="input" maxlength="9" placeholder="例如 100"/><text class="muted form-help">页面会实时读取这个金额；填 0 表示免费报名。</text>
<text class="field-label">报名截止（选填）</text><view class="entry-grid"><picker mode="date" value="{{form.closeDate}}" name="closeDate" data-key="closeDate" bindchange="input"><view class="picker-field">{{form.closeDate || '选择日期'}}</view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{form.closeTime}}" name="closeTime" data-key="closeTime" bindchange="input"><view class="picker-field">{{form.closeTime || '选择时间'}}</view></picker></view><button wx:if="{{form.closeDate || form.closeTime}}" class="text-button" data-kind="registration" bindtap="clearDeadline">清除报名截止设置</button><text class="muted">未填时，在开课时间停止报名。</text>
<text class="field-label">签到截止（选填）</text><view class="entry-grid"><picker mode="date" value="{{form.checkinDate}}" name="checkinDate" data-key="checkinDate" bindchange="input"><view class="picker-field">{{form.checkinDate || '选择日期'}}</view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{form.checkinTime}}" name="checkinTime" data-key="checkinTime" bindchange="input"><view class="picker-field">{{form.checkinTime || '选择时间'}}</view></picker></view><button wx:if="{{form.checkinDate || form.checkinTime}}" class="text-button" data-kind="checkin" bindtap="clearDeadline">清除签到截止设置</button></view>
<view class="card course-form-card"><text class="section-title">报名后的联系说明</text><text class="field-label">进群方式（选填）</text><textarea class="course-form-textarea" value="{{form.groupGuide}}" name="groupGuide" data-key="groupGuide" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" placeholder="可填写工作人员联系方式或进群说明"/><text class="muted form-help">未填写时，可在报名后由工作人员另行联系。</text><text class="field-label">课程群二维码（选填）</text><image wx:if="{{groupQrUrl}}" class="media-preview" src="{{groupQrUrl}}" mode="aspectFit"/><button class="secondary" data-kind="groupQr" bindtap="upload" disabled="{{uploading || busy}}">{{groupQrUrl ? '更换群二维码' : '上传群二维码'}}</button><button wx:if="{{groupQrUrl}}" class="text-button" data-kind="groupQr" bindtap="removeImage">移除群二维码</button><text class="field-label">联系手机号（选填）</text><input class="course-form-input" type="number" maxlength="11" value="{{form.contactPhone}}" name="contactPhone" data-key="contactPhone" bindinput="input" placeholder="可留空"/><text class="field-label">参课须知</text><textarea class="course-form-textarea" value="{{form.notice}}" name="notice" data-key="notice" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" placeholder="如签到要求、携带物品、联系方式等"/></view>
<text wx:if="{{uploading}}" class="muted">图片上传中，请稍候…</text><view wx:if="{{publishError}}" class="error" role="alert">{{publishError}}</view><button class="primary" form-type="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || uploading || loading}}">{{busy ? '正在保存课程…' : status === 'PUBLISHED' ? '保存已发布课程' : '发布课程'}}</button><button wx:if="{{status === 'DRAFT'}}" class="secondary" bindtap="saveDraft" disabled="{{busy || uploading || loading}}">保存草稿</button><button wx:if="{{status !== 'DRAFT'}}" class="secondary" data-status="CLOSED" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || uploading || loading}}">结束本场报名</button><button wx:if="{{hasSavedClass && !saveNotice && status !== 'DRAFT'}}" class="secondary" open-type="share" disabled="{{busy}}">微信分享已保存课程</button><button wx:if="{{hasSavedClass}}" class="text-button" bindtap="preview" disabled="{{busy}}">查看已保存的课程</button></form><button wx:if="{{!loading && !allowed && !error}}" class="primary" bindtap="refresh">登录并核实工作人员身份</button></view>
